---
import { GITHUB_REPO } from "../consts";
---

<section id="developers" class="section developers">
  <div class="developers-inner">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Open source, built with the community</h2>
      <p>
        Mixar is GPL-3.0 licensed and open to contributors. Fork it, extend it, report bugs, or open
        a pull request, whether you write code or just want to follow along.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="developers-highlights">
      <li>Inspectable codebase and a modular architecture</li>
      <li>Real-time audio engine designed for low-latency mixing</li>
      <li>Issues and pull requests welcome at every skill level</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="developers-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={GITHUB_REPO} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Star on GitHub
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/developers">Developer guide</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .developers-inner {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .developers-highlights {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .developers-highlights li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .developers-highlights li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .developers-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
